      "message": "No, it\u0027s very odd that the header for this is provided by libnativeloader, while the actual implementation is in libdl. There even is a TODO that the existing visibilities should be removed. I think exposing these symbols by libnativeloader was a wrong decision which we should fix over time. And I don\u0027t make it worse.\n\nI wish libdl can export the header, but that\u0027s a different topic.\n\nThis internal APIs has been quite stable and aren\u0027t used across the module boundaries. So I think it\u0027s fine to have inlined declaration until the header is exported from libdl.",
